	(text "v3.1: external regulated 3.3V +/-5% only.\nSingle33R0805/E12 per row; transistor gate/bias resistors0603.\nNominal gate pulse <=80us / pixel period 1ms; qualify LED/gate waveforms.\nR11/R12: FIT on one I2C pull-up tile only; DNP on all other tiles.\nJ2: 1 REF, 2 SWIO/PD1, 3 GND; current LinkE cable uses SWIO/GND.\nSame-supply chain only; no hot-plug or 5V interface qualification.\nESP-12F / USB-C buck head deferred by user until hardware qualification.\nButtons removed;40gate/bias0603; PCB synchronization pending."
